              "titleTop": "Welcome to",
              "titleAccent": "EduRise Learning Academy",
              "descriptionLines": [
                "EduRise Learning Academy (ERLA), established in 2010, is a premier business school in India known for its excellence in management",
                "education, research, and industry engagement. Located in New Delhi, ERLA offers a dynamic and career-oriented learning environment, fostering",
                "innovation, leadership, and global perspectives. With a focus on academic rigor, corporate exposure, and holistic development, the institute",
